 e spaccone indaga adesso il maresciallo dei carabinieri Gaetano Cavallo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Soap Opera","overview":"When the kooky tenants of an apartment block experience a sudden and shocking situation, they let their private lives, past secrets and crazy passions intervene as the confessions and absurd twists come thick and fast. Previous lovers, wild accusations, a possible murder and more boil to the surface days before New Year’s Eve, but can they even make it until then?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l04OcbLztyJT4SFLqxdLSniiRr4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2SiIBURQOOXwmjUiJzBKTsqtunK.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":298722,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l04OcbLztyJT4SFLqxdLSniiRr4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l04OcbLztyJT4SFLqxdLSniiRr4.jpg","language":"it","width":600,"height":800},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l04OcbLztyJT4SFLqxdLSniiRr4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l04OcbLztyJT4SFLqxdLSniiRr4.jpg","language":"it","width":600,"height":800},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iS3O48HOgusJogsh5d1dtvLG4bR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iS3O48HOgusJogsh5d1dtvLG4bR.jpg","language":"it","width":643,"height":902},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5LzYwBApevgSOPUpwDqL74c3Mtd.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5LzYwBApevgSOPUpwDqL74c3Mtd.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"available","selec